# Backend Conventions (Project/electro)

## Stack
Spring Boot 3.5.7, Java 17, PostgreSQL 15. JWT auth (HMAC-SHA-512, 24h).

## Layered Architecture
```
Controller → Service → Repository → JPA Entity
```
- Controllers convert Entity ↔ DTO (manual mapping, no MapStruct)
- Stateless REST (JWT, no server sessions)
- Cascade deletion: projects → rooms → points (JPA `cascade`)

## Naming
| Layer | Convention | Example |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Classes | `PascalCase` | `ProjectController` |
| Fields/Methods | `camelCase` | `projectService` |
| REST paths | `kebab-case` | `/cable-types`, `/floor-plan` |
| Request DTOs | `*Request` | `ProjectRequest` |
| Response DTOs | `*Response` | `ProjectResponse` |
| Controllers | `*Controller` | `RoomController` |
| Services | `*Service` | `CalculationService` |
| Repositories | `*Repository` | `ProjectRepository` |

## DTO Conventions
- **Request DTOs** (`dto/request/`): use `jakarta.validation` annotations (`@NotBlank`, `@NotNull`, `@Min`, `@Max`, `@Email`)
- **Response DTOs** (`dto/response/`): plain POJOs, no validation annotations

## Security Rules
```java
.requestMatchers("/api/auth/**").permitAll()
.requestMatchers("/api/admin/**").hasRole("ADMIN")
.requestMatchers("/api/designer/**").hasAnyRole("DESIGNER", "ADMIN")
.requestMatchers("/api/chat/**").hasAnyRole("DESIGNER", "ADMIN")
.requestMatchers("/ws/**").authenticated()
.anyRequest().authenticated()
```
Sessions: `STATELESS`. CSRF: disabled. Passwords: BCrypt.

## Error Handling
```java
// Throw these — GlobalExceptionHandler maps them to HTTP status:
throw new ResourceNotFoundException("Project not found"); // → 404
throw new BadRequestException("Invalid input");           // → 400
// Validation errors (@Valid on @RequestBody) → 400 with field details
```

## WebSocket
- Endpoint: `/ws` (SockJS fallback)
- Brokers: `/topic`, `/queue`; app prefix: `/app`
- Send: `@MessageMapping("/send")` → publish to `/topic/messages`

## File Storage
```
uploads/
├── appliances/    # Appliance images
├── manufacturers/ # Logos
├── profiles/      # User photos
├── chat/          # Chat attachments
└── general/
```
Upload: `POST /api/files/upload` (max 10 MB). Download: `GET /api/files/{filename}`.

## Key Calculation Services
| Service | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `CalculationService` | Power, current, cost, cable lengths |
| `TKP339CalculationService` | Calculations per TKP 339-2022 |
| `TKP339ValidationService` | Validation per TKP 339 |
| `SpecificationService` | Equipment specification generation |
| `PdfExportService` | PDF via iText HTML2PDF |
| `ExcelDataExchangeService` | Excel import/export via Apache POI |
